1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
REPOMIND. Open-source repo-scale coding agent.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Single AMD MI300X. 6.5 days. $4 of compute.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Cursor, Claude, Copilot — all banned

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
at JPMorgan, Apple, the Department of Defense.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
3 million developers locked out.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
AMD blog: 256K context, single GPU, FP8.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
NVIDIA H100 cannot fit.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
AMD MI300X has the headroom.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
We shipped the open-source proof.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,500
62 verified data points · 124 min stress test.

11
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,000
92% peak VRAM.

12
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
An AMD engineer asked publicly about concurrency.

13
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,500
We measured.

14
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:43,500
6.49× faster on 8K vs 32K context.

15
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:47,000
Then we tried AMD's AITER backend.

16
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,500
Throughput jumped 4×, but output broke on FP8 KV cache.

17
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:53,000
We filed the regression upstream.

18
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Default Triton stays production-safe.

19
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Watch live. Real MI300X. Real agent.

20
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
I paste pallets/flask. Click ingest.

21
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
2 seconds. 400K tokens fitted to the window.

22
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,500
Where is the WSGI request entry point?

23
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,000
The agent reasons.

24
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,500
3 grep calls. 1 read with explicit line range.

25
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:18,000
It identifies __call__ at line 1618,

26
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,000
wsgi_app at line 1566.

27
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Real multi-step reasoning on real hardware.

28
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Cursor: $40/seat/month, banned.

29
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,500
REPOMIND: zero per-seat licensing.

30
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:31,500
$18K MI300X capex → break-even in 3 months.

31
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:34,000
I am Sardor Razikov. From Tashkent.

32
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Open to conversations.
